  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "@BBuf @ch-wan could you please review this fix to `_fwd_kernel_ep_scatter_1`? It removes an intra-CTA store/load race by computing each expert's offset locally and writing only its own table entry.\r\n\r\nvLLM fixed the same race in [vllm-project/vllm#34991](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/34991); the PR description includes the reference and a comparison of the two implementations.\r\n",
